1. Vanke Meili Garden, 89 sqm, 1,380,000 yuan, north-south through layout, 800 m from the metro, but built in 2017;
2. Greenland 21 City, 92 sqm, 1,450,000 yuan, owned for over five years and the seller's only property, but 1.2 km from the metro;
3. Xinyuan International City Garden, 95 sqm, 1,420,000 yuan, finely decorated, close to the commercial area, but built in 2015;
4. Greenland Binjiang Hui, 87 sqm, 1,350,000 yuan, high-rise with a good view, but 1.5 km from the metro;
5. Vanke Shanghai Legend, 93 sqm, 1,480,000 yuan, three-bedroom layout with school district, but the total price is slightly over budget.
